# Term 3 African Drumming comes to an end.. Term 4 begins

[![Free online drum classes](/media/2013/08/Drums-Hands-Blur.jpg)](/drumming-classes/free-online-drum-classes/drums-hands-blur/) We would just like to thank all of our African Drumming students for another awesome term! Finally we have seen through the cold and there are only festivals and fun times ahead. We have an exciting new class starting in term 4  and also some cool new weekly community gatherings! so, stay tuned for October's newsletter with all the goss! See you all back in class with new and familiar students coming back on board. Keep an eye out for term 4 course info as there will be changes to course enrolments which will benefit all students. Yay! :)
